    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily backup of workflows to GitHub\nEvery night at midnight (India time), each active workflow is saved to GitHub as `backups/<workflow name>.json`.\n\n- A file is only committed when the workflow **changed** since last night, so quiet nights make no commits.\n- Pinned test data and saved state are **left out**, since they can hold real figures. Credentials are never in a workflow: only their names are.\n- If one upload fails, the rest still run.\n\n**Before the first run:** set the owner, repository and branch in **Backup settings**, and pick your credentials in **Get many workflows** (n8n API) and the three GitHub nodes.\n\nSee `deploy/n8n/backup/BACKUP.md`.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0b0c7a8b-dd8b-46a3-8da1-50e5a111b725",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    }
